WEBVTT

00:16:59.723 --> 00:17:02.851
But that's, I think,
the big structural challenge --

00:17:02.893 --> 00:17:05.771
we would have to take on
speculative investment in housing.

00:17:06.271 --> 00:17:07.731
CA: Thank you, Maja.

00:17:07.773 --> 00:17:13.862
Aaron, I'm really taken
by this argument for UBS,

00:17:13.862 --> 00:17:16.698
partly because, just structurally,

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:19.242
some of those things
naturally get organized better

00:17:19.284 --> 00:17:21.995
if there's only one of them,
not a bunch in competition.

00:17:21.995 --> 00:17:26.416
You compare US health care capitalism
with something like the NHS

00:17:26.458 --> 00:17:28.835
or the state things,
which, for all their faults,

00:17:28.877 --> 00:17:31.797
seem to deliver equally good
or better health care